Backport of mainline c28c22c8cfbd ("drm/fb-helper: Fix clipping when damage
area spans a single scanline"): a write ending at a scanline end, e.g. one
whole row, got x2 = 0 and never reached the panel.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_fb_helper.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_fb_helper.c
@@ -641,7 +641,7 @@
 		 * the number of horizontal pixels that need an update.
 		 */
 		off_t bit_off = (off % line_length) * 8;
-		off_t bit_end = (end % line_length) * 8;
+		off_t bit_end = bit_off + len * 8;
 
 		x1 = bit_off / info->var.bits_per_pixel;
 		x2 = DIV_ROUND_UP(bit_end, info->var.bits_per_pixel);
